{"seq":1,"slug":"claude-code-subagents-and-teams","title":"Claude Code subagents 与 Agent Teams","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/agents/per-tool-agents/claude-code-subagents-and-teams","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"claude-code-subagents-与-agent-teams\">Claude Code subagents 与 Agent Teams</h1><p>Claude Code 把 agent 体系做成两层:<strong>subagent</strong>（fire-and-forget 子任务，跑完返回一次 result）与 <strong>Agent Teams</strong>（长期协作的多 peer agent，shared task list + peer messaging）。前者从 v2.0.x 就在，后者是 Opus 4.6 release (2026-02) 随 v2.1.32+ 引入的 experimental 能力。两者用同一份 <code>.claude/agents/&lt;name&gt;.md</code> 定义文件、共享 isolation 机制，但生命周期与协调模型截然不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  CC[Claude Code session]&#10;  CC --&gt;|description 匹配| Sub[Subagent: 单次 fire-and-forget]&#10;  Sub --&gt; Ret[返回 summary, 终止]&#10;  CC --&gt;|启用 Agent Teams flag| Team[Agent Teams: 长期协作]&#10;  Team --&gt; Lead[Lead AI]&#10;  Lead --&gt; TL[Shared task list]&#10;  TL --&gt; M1[Teammate 1 context]&#10;  TL --&gt; M2[Teammate 2 context]&#10;  TL --&gt; M3[Teammate 3 context]&#10;  M1 &lt;--&gt;|peer message| M2&#10;  M2 &lt;--&gt;|peer message| M3\">flowchart TB\n  CC[Claude Code session]\n  CC --&gt;|description 匹配| Sub[Subagent: 单次 fire-and-forget]\n  Sub --&gt; Ret[返回 summary, 终止]\n  CC --&gt;|启用 Agent Teams flag| Team[Agent Teams: 长期协作]\n  Team --&gt; Lead[Lead AI]\n  Lead --&gt; TL[Shared task list]\n  TL --&gt; M1[Teammate 1 context]\n  TL --&gt; M2[Teammate 2 context]\n  TL --&gt; M3[Teammate 3 context]\n  M1 &lt;--&gt;|peer message| M2\n  M2 &lt;--&gt;|peer message| M3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Subagent</th>\n<th>Agent Teams</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>派生 → 跑 → 返回一次 → 终止</td>\n<td>持续协作 / 多轮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量上限</td>\n<td>主 session 内 N 个并行</td>\n<td>一个 team 多 teammate 长期在线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协调机制</td>\n<td>主 agent ⇄ subagent (二者直连)</td>\n<td>shared task list + teammate peer messaging</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态可见性</td>\n<td>仅 summary 回主</td>\n<td>全 team 看 task list</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>User 干预粒度</td>\n<td>主 agent 处下指令</td>\n<td>可直接对单个 teammate 下指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启用</td>\n<td>默认可用</td>\n<td><code>CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"subagent-定义文件\">Subagent 定义文件</h2><p><code>.claude/agents/code-reviewer.md</code> 的最小可用形:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: code-reviewer&#10;description: Review staged diff for bugs, security, style issues&#10;tools:&#10;  - Read&#10;  - Grep&#10;  - Bash&#10;isolation: worktree&#10;model: claude-opus-4-7&#10;permission-mode: plan&#10;---&#10;&#10;You are a senior code reviewer. Output a structured report with&#10;sections: Bugs / Security / Style / Suggestions. Be specific with&#10;file paths and line numbers.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">code-reviewer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Review staged diff for bugs, security, style issues</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tools</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Grep</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">isolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">worktree</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">claude-opus-4-7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permission-mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">You are a senior code reviewer. Output a structured report with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sections: Bugs / Security / Style / Suggestions. Be specific with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">file paths and line numbers.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>frontmatter 五个字段都不是必填，但生产实践里都该填：<code>name</code> 是派生时的引用名，<code>description</code> 是主 agent description 匹配的关键字源，<code>tools</code> 限制可调工具，<code>isolation: worktree</code> 启用 worktree 隔离，<code>model</code> 显式指定模型，<code>permission-mode</code> 控制 subagent 的写权限。body 部分整段作为 subagent 的 system prompt。</p>\n<p>主 agent 通过 description 自动匹配派生——用户说 &quot;帮我 review 一下&quot; 或主 agent 推理出需要 review 时，自动派 <code>code-reviewer</code>。也可在 Agent tool 调用里显式 <code>subagent_type: &quot;code-reviewer&quot;</code> 强制指定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"agent-teams-启用与结构\">Agent Teams 启用与结构</h2><p>Agent Teams 是 Opus 4.6 release (2026-02) 推出的 experimental 能力。启用方式两种:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# env var&#10;CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1 claude\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># env var</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> claude</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或 settings.json:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;experimental&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;agentTeams&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"experimental\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"agentTeams\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启用后主 agent 升级为 <strong>lead AI</strong>，负责:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>spawn teammates（与 subagent 同一 <code>.claude/agents/&lt;name&gt;.md</code> 定义）</li>\n<li>维护 shared <strong>task list</strong>（source of truth, 三态 <code>pending</code> / <code>in_progress</code> / <code>completed</code>）</li>\n<li>在 dependency 完成时 unblock 阻塞 task</li>\n<li>协调 user 干预（user 可向 lead 或单个 teammate 发指令）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>task list 结构:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- id: t1&#10;  subject: &#39;Add auth middleware to /api/admin/*&#39;&#10;  status: in_progress&#10;  owner: backend-agent&#10;  blocks: [t3]&#10;- id: t2&#10;  subject: &#39;Update README with auth headers&#39;&#10;  status: pending&#10;  owner: docs-agent&#10;  blocked_by: [t1]&#10;- id: t3&#10;  subject: &#39;E2E test the protected route&#39;&#10;  status: pending&#10;  owner: qa-agent&#10;  blocked_by: [t1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Add auth middleware to /api/admin/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">in_progress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">backend-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blocks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Update README with auth headers'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docs-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blocked_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E2E test the protected route'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">qa-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blocked_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>t2</code> 与 <code>t3</code> 都 blocked_by t1——t1 完成时 lead AI 把它们的 status 推进到 pending → 可被 owner 自动 claim。teammate 之间通过 peer message 互相通知 (例如 backend-agent 给 qa-agent 发 &quot;endpoint 上线了, request payload 见附录&quot;)，不必经 lead AI 转交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"peer-to-peer-messaging\">Peer-to-peer messaging</h2><p>Agent Teams 的核心机制之一是 teammate 直连通信:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant U as User&#10;  participant L as Lead AI&#10;  participant B as backend-agent&#10;  participant Q as qa-agent&#10;  participant D as docs-agent&#10;  U-&gt;&gt;L: &quot;增加 admin auth&quot;&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;L: 拆任务到 task list&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;B: assign t1&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;Q: assign t3 (blocked by t1)&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;D: assign t2 (blocked by t1)&#10;  B-&gt;&gt;B: 写 middleware&#10;  B-&gt;&gt;L: t1 done&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;Q: unblock t3&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;D: unblock t2&#10;  B-&gt;&gt;Q: &quot;request header X-Admin-Token 必填&quot;&#10;  Q-&gt;&gt;D: &quot;请把 header X-Admin-Token 写进 README&quot;&#10;  D-&gt;&gt;L: t2 done&#10;  Q-&gt;&gt;L: t3 done\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant U as User\n  participant L as Lead AI\n  participant B as backend-agent\n  participant Q as qa-agent\n  participant D as docs-agent\n  U-&gt;&gt;L: \"增加 admin auth\"\n  L-&gt;&gt;L: 拆任务到 task list\n  L-&gt;&gt;B: assign t1\n  L-&gt;&gt;Q: assign t3 (blocked by t1)\n  L-&gt;&gt;D: assign t2 (blocked by t1)\n  B-&gt;&gt;B: 写 middleware\n  B-&gt;&gt;L: t1 done\n  L-&gt;&gt;Q: unblock t3\n  L-&gt;&gt;D: unblock t2\n  B-&gt;&gt;Q: \"request header X-Admin-Token 必填\"\n  Q-&gt;&gt;D: \"请把 header X-Admin-Token 写进 README\"\n  D-&gt;&gt;L: t2 done\n  Q-&gt;&gt;L: t3 done</pre><p>user 可在任意时刻插入指令到 lead AI 或直接发给某 teammate；teammate 收到指令后更新自己的 plan、必要时给其他 teammate 发协调消息。这种 mesh-style 协调避免 lead AI 成为瓶颈，多 teammate 并发推进的实际吞吐显著高于 &quot;全部经主 agent 转交&quot; 的模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"subagent-与-agent-teams-的边界\">Subagent 与 Agent Teams 的边界</h2><p>两者的边界用一个表区分清楚:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>选 subagent</th>\n<th>选 Agent Teams</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务一次性 / 短时长</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多个独立子任务无依赖</td>\n<td>是 (subagent + worktree + <code>/batch</code>)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 worker 互相协调 / 有依赖 / 长会话</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要 user 直接对单个 worker 发指令</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只想隔离 context 让主 session 清爽</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>过度设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个朴素的判断:<strong>&quot;我是否需要 task list?&quot;</strong> 需要 → Agent Teams；不需要 → subagent。Subagent 是 fire-and-forget 的子函数，Agent Teams 是常驻协作的迷你公司。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><p>第一坑是把 Agent Teams 当成 &quot;subagent 的多个实例&quot;——Teams 有 task list / peer messaging / 长生命周期等 subagent 没有的机制，不是简单的并行 subagent。</p>\n<p>第二坑是没开 flag 就期待 Teams 行为——<code>CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1</code> 不开时主 agent 派 subagent 还是单次 fire-and-forget。</p>\n<p>第三坑是同一 <code>.claude/agents/&lt;name&gt;.md</code> 同时被 subagent 派生与 Teams teammate 使用——两种用法定义文件共享但运行时语义不同，subagent 期望返回一次 summary、teammate 期望长期在线，prompt 措辞 (&quot;Return a structured report&quot; vs &quot;Coordinate with other teammates&quot;) 应根据预期场景调整。</p>\n<p>第四坑是用 Teams 跑同文件并发 edits——teammates 互相 wait 反而比 single session 慢。Teams 适合任务间有逻辑依赖但物理上不冲突的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Claude Code agent 两层结构:subagent (fire-and-forget) + Agent Teams (长期协作)</li>\n<li>共享 <code>.claude/agents/&lt;name&gt;.md</code> 定义文件 (frontmatter + body)</li>\n<li>Agent Teams 需 <code>CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1</code> 启用，依赖 v2.1.32+ / Opus 4.6 (2026-02)</li>\n<li>核心机制:shared task list + 三态 + dependency 解锁 + teammate peer messaging</li>\n<li>边界:需要 task list 与多 worker 协调用 Teams，单次脏活用 subagent</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"codex-agents-supervisor\"><code>2_codex-agents-supervisor.md</code></a> 看 OpenAI Codex App 的桌面 supervisor 模型，相比 Claude 对话式 orchestration 的另一种哲学。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Claude Code subagents 与 Agent Teams","id":"claude-code-subagents-与-agent-teams"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Subagent 定义文件","id":"subagent-定义文件"},{"level":2,"text":"Agent Teams 启用与结构","id":"agent-teams-启用与结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Peer-to-peer messaging","id":"peer-to-peer-messaging"},{"level":2,"text":"Subagent 与 Agent Teams 的边界","id":"subagent-与-agent-teams-的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Fork mode 与 prompt cache 经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/agents/subagent-fundamentals/fork-mode-and-prompt-cache"},"next":{"title":"Codex App 桌面 supervisor 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/agents/per-tool-agents/codex-agents-supervisor"}}